        {
          "text": "Ngokuba kwavela kuJehova ukwenza lukhuni izinhliziyo zabo ukuba bahlasele u-Israyeli, abashaye ngesiqalekiso esichithayo, bangabi namusa, kodwa ukubachitha, njengalokho uJehova emyalile uMose.",
