          "text": "UJoshuwa walithatha izwe lonke njengakho konke uJehova abekushilo kuMose; uJoshuwa walinika u-Israyeli laba yifa ngokwezigaba zabo ngokwezizwe zabo. Izwe lazola ekulweni.",
